        "slider",
        "alert",
        "empty",
        "skeleton",
        "separator",
        "spinner",
        "input"
      ],
      "dependencies": ["@tabler/icons-react"],
      "docs": "The default installation includes the lightweight page engine only. Optional engines (premier, scroll, curl, spread, archival-curl, webgl, pdf) live in the book-preview-engines item and require page-flip, pdfjs-dist, three, @react-three/fiber, @react-three/drei, and maath when those modes are enabled. Requires Base UI primitives (a base-* shadcn project): usage relies on render props, scalar Slider values, and array-valued ToggleGroup state. Do not treat qualitative capability labels as measured performance guarantees.",
